window.__T__=[{"i":19080,"text":"请基于我上传的照片，制作一张独立的 3:4竖版「巨物尺度双生」海报，画面上下严格 1:1分割。\n上半：完整保留原始照片，仅轻微统一调色。\n下半：严格保持 同一人物、同一张脸、同一服装、同一动作、同一主体身份和核心构图，选择原图中的一个普通物件，将其放大为 建筑级巨物。\n巨物可以是：\n手机 / 相机 / 书 / 咖啡杯 / 鞋 / 香水瓶 / 包装盒 / 产品\n要求：\n- 巨物比人物大数十倍\n- 保留原物件真实材质和结构\n- 人物与巨物产生真实尺度关系\n- 保持正确透视\n- 保持真实接触阴影\n- 保持真实空间遮挡\n- 画面像真实摄影，不像玩具模型\n最终效果像：\n同一个人突然进入了一个普通物件被放大100倍的现实世界。\n禁止：\n- 禁止换脸\n- 禁止Q版人物\n- 禁止把人物缩成玩具\n- 禁止人物从物体里钻出来\n- 禁止破屏效果\n- 禁止普通拼贴\n- 禁止模型感过强\n- 禁止明显AI畸变\n\n🔁延伸玩法\n人物照\n手机、相机、耳机、咖啡杯都可以直接放大。\n旅行照\n把行李箱、地图、相机变成巨型场景，人物像进入旅行道具世界。\n产品照\n直接让产品变成城市里的巨大装置，很适合广告视觉。\n汽车照片\n可以把车钥匙、方向盘、轮胎做成巨型空间。\n美食照片\n咖啡、蛋糕、冰淇淋、水果都能变成巨型场景。\n\n📌一句话总结\n上传一张普通照片，让AI把身边一个东西直接放大100倍。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTbtKwBagAAo7d5.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTbtKv6aMAA6NlE.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTbtKv5aAAAUfOb.jpg"]},{"i":19081,"text":"Create a visually striking split-scene artwork showing [LANDMARK / CITY / COUNTRY] in two artistic worlds.\n\nTop half: a cinematic, photorealistic view of [LANDMARK], captured during a beautiful [morning/golden-hour/evening], with authentic architecture, local people, atmosphere, street details, natural lighting, realistic textures, and strong cinematic depth. Include recognizable cultural details that immediately establish the location.\n\nBottom half: the exact same scene reimagined as a handmade child’s drawing, created with rough colored pencils, wax crayons, imperfect strokes, scribbled textures, uneven outlines, innocent proportions, visible paper grain, playful colors, and charming imperfections. Keep the important landmarks and visual elements recognizable but make them feel lovingly drawn from memory.\n\nBetween the two worlds, place a small torn piece of cream paper with handwritten text: “[SHORT EMOTIONAL PHRASE]”.\n\nThe transition should feel like reality turning into a childhood memory. Warm nostalgic atmosphere, tactile paper texture, subtle imperfections, editorial composition, emotionally charming, highly detailed, artistic but believable. No clean digital illustration, no glossy 3D render, no overly polished cartoon.\nThe strongest visual hook is keeping the same composition in both halves so the viewer immediately recognizes that the crayon drawing is the child’s imaginative/memory version of the real place.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTb7yinaYAA1zgi.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTb7yibasAAdD8t.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTb7yiCbUAAmr49.jpg"]},{"i":19082,"text":"{\n  \"prompt_name\": \"Subject Portrait + Minimalist Circle Logo Poster\",\n  \"canvas\": {\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"3:4\",\n    \"orientation\": \"vertical\",\n    \"layout\": \"split composition, two stacked halves (upper / lower)\"\n  },\n  \"input_handling\": {\n    \"source\": \"user-uploaded reference image\",\n    \"subject_detection\": \"Identify the primary subject (person, cat, dog, or other animal) and treat it as the sole focus for both halves\",\n    \"identity_consistency\": \"Both halves must clearly depict the same individual subject\"\n  },\n  \"upper_half\": {\n    \"role\": \"Realistic subject presentation\",\n    \"content\": \"The main subject isolated from the original photo\",\n    \"preserve\": [\n      \"authentic physical features\",\n      \"hairstyle or fur contours\",\n      \"key facial features and recognition points\",\n      \"clothing or fur color and markings\",\n      \"overall temperament and expression\"\n    ],\n    \"background_treatment\": \"Minimize architecture and surroundings; keep the environment subdued, blurred, or neutral so the subject stands out alone\"\n  },\n  \"lower_half\": {\n    \"role\": \"Logo-style reinterpretation of the same subject\",\n    \"background\": \"Pure white, clean and uncluttered\",\n    \"core_graphic\": {\n      \"shape\": \"Solid black perfect circle\",\n      \"interior\": \"A partial side-profile or head contour of the subject rendered inside the circle\",\n      \"detail_level\": \"Keep only the essential facial or pet features needed for instant recognition as the same subject shown above\"\n    },\n    \"subject_rules\": {\n      \"if_person\": \"Focus on the side profile, half-profile, or head silhouette\",\n      \"if_pet\": \"Focus on the head, ears, muzzle, or side-profile contour\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"style\": {\n    \"overall\": \"Ultra-minimalist flat logo design\",\n    \"aesthetic\": \"Japanese sensibility blended with modern design\",\n    \"qualities\": [\n      \"clean and restrained\",\n      \"refined and sophisticated\",\n      \"crisp, sharp contour lines\",\n      \"strong flat planes and shapes\",\n      \"high recognizability\",\n      \"clear visual focus\",\n      \"strong logo feel and graphic identity\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"constraints\": {\n    \"exclude\": [\n      \"any text or titles\",\n      \"letters or characters\",\n      \"logos or brand marks\",\n      \"watermarks\",\n      \"similar overlay elements\"\n    ]\n  }\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTcItqfbsAAiViN.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTcItoZbQAEE_5c.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTcItokaUAAHz93.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTcItocbUAAuk5R.jpg"]},{"i":19083,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n主题方向： 东方禅意极简秋日封面海报\n风格分支： 女性审美明亮秋日型\n主体内容： 一位古风女子缓慢经过一面明亮白墙，抬起一只手轻轻接住从树梢飘落的一片银杏叶\n情绪母题： 清朗、从容、治愈、秋日明媚感\n场景与意象： 奶油白墙面、金黄色银杏枝叶、少量橙红秋柿、飘落银杏叶、女子、清晰树影\n构图与空间： 9:16 竖版，白墙占画面约三分之二作为主要负空间，人物位于下方偏左，秋枝从右上方斜向进入，巨大树影铺展在右侧墙面，左上方保留完整标题区\n色彩控制： 奶油白作为高明度墙面与空间基底，银杏金黄用于主要秋叶，少量柿子橙红作为第二视觉点，人物服装保持浅米白与珍珠白，树影使用自然中性灰；避免整图土黄化、橙化或套暖色滤镜\n光线与质感： 晴朗秋日下午侧光，明亮通透，树影轮廓清晰，墙面保留细腻浅纸感与自然纹理，边缘干净，不使用雾化和旧纸颗粒\n画幅比例： 9:16\n补充要求： 秋叶数量克制，枝头柿子只保留少量点睛；人物比例自然纤细、姿态轻盈，手掌向上自然接叶；整体高明度、鲜活而不俗，保留大面积呼吸感与女性向高传播封面感；留白处可配置东方书法标题与少量现代宋体小字","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HThghmDaIAEwXKB.jpg"]},{"i":19084,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n风格方向： 周末打闹俏皮互动情绪\n场景方向： 客厅地毯 / 沙发前 / 矮茶几\n服装方向： 浅薰衣草紫修身短袖上衣 + 奶白柔软家居短裙\n气质标签： 俏皮、亲密、元气、松弛、轻甜\n身形方向： 丰腴自然曲线\n线条强调： 中偏强\n镜头方向： 女生自然坐在地毯上，一条腿弯曲、一条腿向侧前方放松，一只手撑地保持稳定，另一只手笑着伸向镜头，像正在抢男友手里的手机，身体轻微前倾，眼神直接追着镜头\n画幅比例： 9:16\n互动重点： 镜头可以有轻微倾斜和距离变化，形成男友向后躲、女生伸手来抢的即时抓拍感。\n曲线重点： 地面坐姿 + 前倾动作自然表现腰腹、大腿和上半身比例，同时不容易变成刻意写真。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTnQKScbMAAW5WD.jpg"]},{"i":19085,"text":"Create a 30-second ultra-realistic cinematic cooking video of a skilled Chinese chef preparing spicy-and-sour fish in a professional kitchen. The chef wears a clean white chef uniform. Fast, precise cooking movements, realistic food textures, authentic fire, steam and oil physics, natural human motion, cinematic food photography. No text, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.\n\n[0–4s] — FISH PREPARATION\nThe chef firmly holds a fresh whole fish on a wooden cutting board. With fast, controlled knife movements, the chef removes the head and smoothly follows the spine, separating the fish into clean fillets. Realistic knife sounds and subtle moisture details.\n\n[4–8s] — THIN SLICING\nThe fillet is placed flat on the board. The chef rapidly slices it into extremely thin, delicate pieces with precise wrist movements. The translucent slices fall naturally one after another, revealing detailed fish texture and moisture.\n\n[8–11s] — SEASONING\nThe fish slices are transferred into a bowl and coated with spices and a light marinade. The chef quickly tosses and mixes them until every piece is evenly coated with a smooth, glossy layer.\n\n[11–15s] — WOK AND AROMATICS\nA heavy iron wok heats over a strong blue-orange flame. Oil begins to shimmer. Pickled mustard greens, pickled chilies, garlic, and spices are thrown into the wok. They immediately sizzle as the chef rapidly tosses the ingredients, filling the scene with realistic steam and aromatic heat.\n\n[15–20s] — COOKING THE FISH\nRich stock is poured into the wok and reaches a vigorous boil. The chef carefully adds the delicate fish slices and controls the wok with quick, precise movements, keeping the fish intact. A light starch slurry is added while the wok is rotated in smooth arcs, creating a silky, glossy sauce that coats every slice.\n\n[20–24s] — PLATING\nThe cooked fish is carefully transferred into a deep serving dish. White fish slices settle among golden pickled vegetables and red chilies. The glossy sauce flows naturally around the fish while steam rises from the hot dish.\n\n[24–27s] — HOT OIL FINISH\nFresh minced garlic and dried red chilies are arranged on top. The chef pours scorching hot oil over them. A powerful, realistic sizzling reaction erupts, sending fragrant steam upward as the toppings bloom in the hot oil.\n\n[27–30s] — FINAL HERO SHOT\nThe camera slowly pushes toward the finished dish. Tender white fish, golden pickled vegetables, bright red chilies, glossy sauce, fresh garlic, and swirling steam fill the frame. End on an irresistible macro close-up of the bubbling, freshly cooked spicy-and-sour fish.\n\nUltra-realistic food cinematography, photorealistic chef, authentic Chinese cooking technique, realistic knife handling, detailed fish texture, natural steam and fire, physically accurate oil movement, cinematic depth of field, subtle handheld camera movement, warm professional kitchen lighting, macro food details, high dynamic range, 4K, premium food commercial quality.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2105297934476849152/img/4GpwaJ3TbjOxJ9VU.jpg"]},{"i":19086,"text":"Elegant woman sitting inside a classic luxury car, wearing an oversized wide-brimmed hat, round dark sunglasses, leather gloves, and sculptural jewelry. One hand is gracefully adjusting the brim of the hat. Tightly framed fashion portrait, mid-shot composition.\n\nHigh-contrast monochrome photography, deep velvet blacks, crisp highlights, shot on 90mm lens, f/2.8, shallow depth of field. Inspired by the refined vintage editorial aesthetic of Peter Lindbergh and Paolo Roversi, timeless sophisticated atmosphere.\n\nTactile textures including fine-grain leather, smooth sculptural metal, and woven straw. Subtle light reflections on the windshield, soft interior shadows.\n\nNo text, no watermarks, no distorted facial features, no oversaturated tones, no low-quality digital noise.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTeHsBiacAA3rJn.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTeHsBlaAAAl3dL.jpg"]},{"i":19087,"text":"请生成一张用于四方连续设计的平面纹样单元，画幅1:1。\n主题：【柠檬花园】\n主要元素：【柠檬、白色小花、弯曲叶枝】\n辅助元素：【少量卷曲果皮】\n背景颜色：【奶油白】\n主体配色：【柠檬黄、鼠尾草绿、暖白】\n绘画风格：【手绘水粉，轻微纸张颗粒】\n排列密度：【中等，元素之间保留清楚间隙】\n将主要元素分成大、中、小三种尺寸，朝向自然变化，均匀分布在画面中。辅助元素只填补较大的空隙，不抢占主要元素的位置。对象保持清楚可辨，避免互相粘连、过度重叠和整齐的棋盘排列。\n不要中心主角、中央花束或四角空白。只画平面图案，不生成包装盒、布料、房间或产品样机。\n按可重复平铺的目标处理四边：左边越出的元素在右边相同高度续接，上边越出的元素在下边相同水平位置续接；对应位置的形状、颜色和背景明度保持一致，并考虑四角连续关系。不要边框、边缘渐暗或方向性投影。\n只输出一张纹样单元，不输出多格预览。不添加文字、数字、标志或水印。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n海边版\n主题换成【海边拾贝】，主要元素换成【扇贝、海螺、海草】，辅助元素换成【少量卵石】，配色用【浅橙、鼠尾草绿、暖灰】。\n咖啡版\n主题换成【午后咖啡】，主要元素换成【咖啡杯、咖啡豆、叶枝】，辅助元素换成【少量杯碟】，配色用【鼠尾草绿、暖棕、陶土橙】。\n同一主题再试一疏一密，只修改【排列密度】，对照哪版更适合你的用途。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n换掉【】里的元素，保留控制结构；好看的纹样，还要经得起拼接检查","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTgtu82bwAExDTC.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTgtyj5aEAAR3fG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTgtyj8bUAAc6iS.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTgtykIaEAE4XHU.jpg"]},{"i":19088,"text":"Create a highly detailed “Architectural Passport” travel poster for [CITY / LANDMARK], designed to look like a premium collectible art print that blends colored-pencil illustration, fine ink drawing, vintage architectural documentation, and subtle watercolor texture.\n\nPlace the landmark as the dramatic hero, drawn with intricate hand-rendered details, realistic perspective, delicate pencil hatching, visible paper grain, and carefully controlled pops of natural color. Surround it with a faint city map, street names, architectural measurements, tiny elevation sketches, construction lines, botanical details, directional arrows, and miniature diagrammatic studies.\n\nUse an elegant warm ivory paper background with mostly muted graphite, charcoal, terracotta, olive green, dusty blue, and warm beige tones. Keep the background extremely clean and editorial, allowing the landmark to visually emerge from the page.\n\nAdd sophisticated typography:\n[CITY]\n[LANDMARK NAME]\nsmall coordinates, founding/construction date, architectural style, neighborhood name, and tiny archival annotations.\n\nInclude one or two miniature architectural detail drawings beside the main structure, as if taken from an architect’s sketchbook. Add subtle imperfections: pencil smudges, uneven ink pressure, erased construction marks, paper fibers, faint halftone texture, and hand-drawn annotation marks.\n\nThe composition should feel like a cross between a vintage travel poster, an architectural magazine cover, a museum exhibition print, and a designer’s sketchbook.\n\nVisual hook: make the landmark extremely detailed and colorful while the surrounding city information remains almost ghost-like, creating a striking contrast between “the place” and “the blueprint of the place.”\n\nVertical 4:5 composition, premium editorial design, sophisticated negative space, ultra-detailed hand illustration, realistic architectural perspective, tactile paper texture, collectible poster aesthetic, visually striking at thumbnail size, no photorealistic rendering, no 3D CGI look.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTgw7Dma8AA7PGY.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTgw7DkbIAAjFdX.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTgw7DiagAA9SNs.jpg"]},{"i":19089,"text":"DESTINATION: [CITY / DESTINATION]\nCOUNTRY: [COUNTRY]\n\nCreate a sophisticated vertical 2:3 premium architectural travel postcard for [DESTINATION], [COUNTRY].\n\nCORE STYLE\n\nUse the visual language of a high-end contemporary architectural travel poster combined with refined vintage editorial illustration.\n\nThe design should feel:\n- elegant\n- cultured\n- timeless\n- architectural\n- collectible\n- premium\n- museum-shop quality\n\nCombine extremely detailed architectural pen-and-ink illustration, delicate graphite linework, restrained watercolor-style flat color, archival cartographic graphics, elegant editorial typography, and generous white space.\n\nDo NOT make it look like a generic tourist poster.\n\nMAIN ARCHITECTURAL HERO\n\nSelect ONE iconic and instantly recognizable architectural landmark strongly associated with [DESTINATION].\n\nExamples can include:\n- historic monument\n- palace\n- cathedral\n- mosque\n- temple\n- tower\n- bridge\n- government building\n- famous street façade\n- traditional architectural landmark\n- modern architectural icon\n\nThe selected landmark must be the dominant visual subject.\n\nShow it from a believable three-quarter or slightly dramatic architectural perspective.\n\nMaintain accurate architectural proportions and recognizable structural details.\n\nDo not combine multiple major landmarks into one main illustration.\n\nILLUSTRATION STYLE\n\nRender the main landmark using exceptionally fine black or dark graphite ink lines.\n\nInclude:\n- detailed architectural hatching\n- precise windows\n- doors\n- columns\n- roofs\n- arches\n- ornaments\n- façade details\n- realistic structural geometry\n- subtle hand-drawn imperfections\n\nKeep the architecture primarily as detailed line art with selective flat color.\n\nUse refined illustrative detailing rather than photorealistic rendering.\n\nCOLOR PALETTE\n\nUse mostly white space with only 2–4 sophisticated destination-specific colors.\n\nChoose colors naturally associated with [DESTINATION] or the landmark.\n\nExamples:\n- muted architectural stone tones\n- traditional local colors\n- restrained blue\n- muted green\n- terracotta\n- burgundy\n- soft red\n- architectural gold\n- subtle natural tones\n\nColors should be elegant and slightly muted.\n\nAvoid:\n- neon colors\n- excessive saturation\n- gradients\n- glossy effects\n- muddy sepia\n- excessive beige\n- photorealistic color grading\n\nBACKGROUND\n\nUse a clean pure white background.\n\nBehind the architecture, add extremely subtle archival graphic elements such as:\n\n- faint city map\n- street plan\n- river outline\n- coordinates\n- contour lines\n- architectural diagram\n- compass\n- grid lines\n- local-language annotations\n- minimal geographical markings\n\nThese elements must remain secondary and lightly faded.\n\nDo not allow the background map to overpower the main architecture.\n\nCOMPOSITION\n\nUse a vertical 2:3 editorial composition.\n\nThe main landmark should occupy approximately 60–75% of the artwork.\n\nCreate generous negative space around the typography and architectural subject.\n\nUse an asymmetric premium editorial layout.\n\nThe composition should feel carefully designed rather than centered like a basic tourist souvenir.\n\nTasteful cropping is allowed when it creates a stronger architectural composition.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY\n\nAt the top or upper-left area, display:\n\n[DESTINATION]\n\nUse large elegant high-contrast editorial serif typography inspired by premium architecture magazines and museum catalogues.\n\nBelow it, optionally include:\n\n[LOCAL NAME]\n\nusing the authentic local writing system of the destination.\n\nFor example:\nSeoul\n서울\n\nLondon\nLondon\n\nTokyo\n東京\n\nParis\nParis\n\nUse restrained typography with generous letter spacing.\n\nDo not use giant decorative typography that overwhelms the architecture.\n\nSECONDARY INFORMATION\n\nInclude a small elegant information block containing destination-specific details such as:\n\n[SHORT DESTINATION DESCRIPTION]\n\n[COORDINATES]\n\n[LOCAL NAME]\n\n[COUNTRY]\n\nUse tiny refined typography with generous spacing.\n\nOptional subtle elements:\n\n- compass\n- small architectural sketch\n- miniature landmark drawing\n- local-language stamp-like mark\n- faint map label\n\nKeep all secondary elements minimal.\n\nARCHIVAL MAP ELEMENT\n\nInclude a very subtle map or street-plan layer related specifically to [DESTINATION].\n\nIf the destination has a recognizable river, coastline, mountain, historic district, or urban grid, integrate it naturally into the background.\n\nAdd a small understated geographical label where appropriate.\n\nDo not create a cluttered map.\n\nCONTEXTUAL DETAILS\n\nAdd only a few tiny environmental elements when they naturally belong to the location:\n\n- pedestrians\n- bicycles\n- trees\n- street lamps\n- local vehicles\n- benches\n- small street details\n- birds\n\nThese elements should primarily establish scale and atmosphere.\n\nDo not turn the image into a busy city scene.\n\nDESTINATION AUTHENTICITY\n\nMake the architecture, typography, environmental details, colors, map elements, and small contextual objects culturally and geographically appropriate to [DESTINATION], [COUNTRY].\n\nAvoid generic architecture that could belong to another city.\n\nThe landmark must immediately communicate the destination.\n\nVISUAL HIERARCHY\n\nPriority order:\n\n1. Main architectural landmark\n2. Destination name\n3. Supporting map / archival graphics\n4. Local-language name\n5. Small contextual details\n6. Coordinates and information strip\n\nEverything should support the main landmark.\n\nBOTTOM INFORMATION STRIP\n\nAt the bottom, add a refined museum-catalogue-style information strip:\n\n[DESTINATION]  |  [COUNTRY]  |  [ARCHITECTURAL STYLE]  |  EST. [YEAR]\n\nKeep it small, elegant, evenly spaced, and understated.\n\nIf the landmark's construction date is uncertain, use an appropriate historical date or omit the year rather than inventing information.\n\nMOOD\n\nQuiet urban sophistication.\n\nCultural authenticity.\n\nArchitectural heritage.\n\nModern editorial design.\n\nHistorical character combined with contemporary graphic design.\n\nThe final artwork should feel like a premium collectible architectural print purchased from a museum design shop.\n\nAVOID\n\nNo landmark collage.\n\nNo fake architecture.\n\nNo random buildings.\n\nNo generic tourist-poster aesthetic.\n\nNo cartoon style.\n\nNo 3D rendering.\n\nNo glossy photorealism.\n\nNo excessive vintage filters.\n\nNo heavy sepia.\n\nNo fake passport stamps.\n\nNo excessive decorative elements.\n\nNo clutter.\n\nNo giant unnecessary text.\n\nNo random flags.\n\nNo inaccurate cultural symbols.\n\nNo distorted architecture.\n\nNo unrealistic perspective.\n\nNo excessive gradients.\n\nNo excessive beige.\n\nFINAL GOAL\n\nCreate a highly detailed, sophisticated, timeless architectural travel postcard that could work consistently for ANY city or country while maintaining the same premium visual identity.\n\nOnly change the destination-specific elements such as:\n\n[DESTINATION]\n[COUNTRY]\n[ICONIC LANDMARK]\n[LOCAL NAME]\n[ARCHITECTURAL STYLE]\n[COORDINATES]\n[ESTABLISHED / CONSTRUCTION YEAR]\n[DESTINATION-SPECIFIC COLORS]\n[MAP / GEOGRAPHICAL ELEMENTS]\n\nEverything else should maintain the same refined editorial postcard design language.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTg3m-EbgAAPfgk.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTg3m-BaUAAbcot.jpg"]},{"i":19090,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n主题方向： 东方禅意极简国庆封面海报\n风格分支： 国庆女性审美明亮高传播型\n主体内容： 一位古风女子站在白色高台边，抬手望向被风轻轻吹起的一幅朱红长帛\n情绪母题： 明朗、喜悦、向上、山河清朗\n场景与意象： 象牙白高台、朱红长帛、晴空蓝天空、少量金桂枝叶、女子、极淡远山\n构图与空间： 9:16 竖版，女子位于画面下方偏右，朱红长帛从右上方斜向进入并形成明显视觉动线，天空与白色墙面占据约三分之二画幅，上方偏左保留完整标题区，远山只作为极淡空间层次\n色彩控制： 象牙白作为高明度空间基底，晴空蓝用于天空和少量远景空气层，朱红只用于迎风长帛和极少局部点睛，桂花金用于少量枝叶与细节，人物服装保持月白或浅杏白；形成红、蓝、白之间鲜明但干净的节庆对比，避免全图泛红、泛金或套暖色滤镜\n光线与质感： 国庆晴日上午明亮自然光，空气清透，轮廓清晰，白色高台有干净高光，长帛保留轻薄透光与自然褶皱，现代东方平面海报感，轻微纸面质感即可\n画幅比例： 9:16\n补充要求： 节庆感要鲜明但不要传统宣传画感；不要烟花、彩带、人群、复杂建筑和大面积红色背景；女子比例纤细自然，姿态舒展；整体高明度、低灰度、轻盈通透，有明显女性审美和小红书高传播封面感；留白处配置少量东方书法标题和现代宋体小字","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTm_284b0AAqIwh.jpg"]},{"i":19091,"text":"Create an exceptionally artistic cinematic portrait of a person, designed as a visual representation of their quiet inner world.\n\nShow the person standing beside a large old window in a softly lit vintage room. Their face and identity remain natural, realistic, and highly detailed. They are not posing directly for the camera; instead, capture a subtle candid moment as they look slightly away, as if lost in thought.\n\nThe room should feel like a collection of memories: an open old book, a half-filled teacup, handwritten notes, dried flowers, a small vintage clock, scattered photographs, and delicate curtains moving slightly in the breeze.\n\nCreate a beautiful contrast between warm sunlight entering through the window and soft cool shadows surrounding the subject. Let tiny dust particles float through the light, creating a dreamy atmospheric glow.\n\nUse muted earthy tones, warm ivory, faded brown, dusty beige, soft sage, and subtle golden highlights. Natural skin texture, realistic eyes, delicate hair strands, soft fabric details, cinematic depth of field.\n\nAdd subtle visual storytelling: reflections in the window should contain faint, almost imperceptible fragments of landscapes, clouds, trees, and distant mountains, as though the person's memories are quietly appearing in the glass.\n\nComposition should feel like a frame from an intimate arthouse film — elegant, peaceful, nostalgic, sophisticated, emotionally expressive without being dramatic.\n\nEditorial photography + cinematic realism + fine-art portraiture + nostalgic film grain + soft natural light + subtle analog texture.\n\nNo excessive makeup, no artificial beauty retouching, no exaggerated pose, no fantasy costume, no plastic skin, no text, no watermark.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTh264fbEAA6Zrg.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTh27c2akAACMJD.jpg"]},{"i":19092,"text":"【全局画质设定】\n3D国漫电影级CG动画，电影级PBR材质、高精度角色与建筑模型、全局光照、HDR高动态范围、电影色彩管理、细腻胶片颗粒、真实发丝与布料物理反馈。上元灯市满月夜，暖金灯火为环境底色，银白与幽青为对立能量色。高速动作中角色面部、手部、兵器与接触点保持清晰，动态模糊只给背景与画面边缘。\n\n【整体战斗概念】\n30秒全程高速1v1，女剑客白栀持长剑「照霰」（银白剑气），与刺客夜青客（玄铁骨折扇、幽青能量）在上元灯市长街交手。第一秒直接开打，无对峙、无站定、无停顿：两人沿牌坊长街→三层主灯楼市脊飞檐连廊→街口灯棚单向流动，一路贴地连段、踏棚上楼、飞檐交锋、高空坠击。全片五次技能峰值均铺满画面（每次1.5至2秒），主体以逆光剪影或边缘轮廓保持可读、接触点不被遮。B打出唯一重击命中（受力慢镜特写），A终局以剑气化龙撞碎B折扇反制。无对白、无战吼、无技能名称字幕。\n\n【角色资产】\nA ：青年男性@图1 ，\nB ：青年男性@图2 ，\n【武器与能力系统】\nA 长剑「照霰」：银白剑格、霜白剑脊、绯红剑穗，能量为银白色剑气。\nB 玄铁骨折扇：合为短棍、展开为扇刃，能量为幽青色。\n每次技能六步齐全：动作中起手（不站桩聚气）→动作引导能量沿主轨迹释放→传播（尾迹、粒子、被照亮的环境）→相遇或命中（接触点清晰）→身体与环境响应→1.5至2秒内衰减、战果显露。\n\n【世界场景】\n上元灯市长街，满月当空。锚点（开场2秒内随扑击动作全部入画、之后每镜至少保留一个）：青石牌坊、两侧花灯棚、三层主灯楼、街口戏台旗杆、满月。长街为青石旱地，无水面；空中飘有零星纸灰与灯穗。场景随战斗单向推进、不折返。\n\n【视觉特效体系】\n五次全屏技能峰值，形态按线性长河、流体青浪、弧光残影、网状锁链、立体剑龙错开，配色锁定银白与幽青：\n①流霰（A，线性）：长剑横扫引动千道银白剑气，如光之长河铺满整条长街与画面，B在光流中以折扇连封、被推着滑退。\n②幽罗掌（B，流体）：双掌推出幽青能量化作滔天青浪（能量流体，不是水），铺满灯楼市脊与整个画面，瓦当成排掀飞。\n③惊鸿（A，弧光）：腾空连斩三叠，漫天银白弧光与2至3道残影铺满画面，从不同角度压下。\n④青锁（B，网状）：振腕旋扇，数十道幽青锁链自画面四周铺满，缠缚A四肢与长剑。\n⑤剑龙照霰（A，立体，终局）：周身银白能量爆燃，漫天剑气汇聚成一条巨大银白剑龙，龙身由千万剑气组成、铺满整个画面，剑龙俯冲撞向B。\n幽青能量被击碎时呈幽青粒子爆散；银白剑气消散后只留剑上残弧与飘落星屑。技能余波只留焦黑裂纹、碎瓦与碎屑，不残留发光法阵圈。\n\n【战斗原则】\n1. 每秒都有运动：禁止两人对峙、站定对视、停手观望；即使格挡也在滑步、蹬踏或腾空中完成。\n2. 攻击快速直接，起手不超过1秒且起手期间保持位移，禁止长蓄力、长前摇、摆姿势等技能。\n3. 每轮交锋读出：谁动、往哪、是否接触、对手如何反应、最后运动到哪里；被挡与落空的失败动作必须存在。\n4. 双方主动发起次数等量：B主动突袭、掌浪压制、锁链缚身并命中一掌；A主动剑气突进、弧光反压、剑龙决胜。\n5. 先接触后特效：命中先于火星、震屏、音效与受力后果；受力必有来源与方向，无支点不腾空、距离不突变。\n6. 非致命：胜负用碎扇、护体炸裂、击退滑退、无力再战表现，无血液无伤口特写。\n\n【镜头语言】\n高速电影镜头流，每镜一个叙事目的、一个主运镜：冷开场用牌坊顶俯拍接B下坠、A迎击；长街段贴地低机位高速跟拍与横向甩镜；上楼段蹬棚仰摇接屋脊环绕（环绕不超过180度）；惊鸿段以檐柱为轴有限环绕读全三叠弧光；青锁段急坠跟拍；掌击升格为贴身近景固定微推；剑龙段先贴人推镜再随龙首俯冲；收尾镜头持续后拉升高。通过灯笼、披帛、爆散粒子与掠过檐角自然遮挡转场，遮挡约三分之二画幅、不硬切，切镜延续位置、朝向、动量与伤损。\n\n【声音设计】\n五层：长街夜风与远处灯市人声为底噪；衣料破风、脚步蹬踏、剑鸣为运动层；兵器交击为短促金属CLANG、法术为低频嗡鸣积蓄到释放轰响、剑龙为低沉龙吟般的能量轰鸣；余势层含瓦当碎裂、灯柱断裂、碎扇落地、坠地滑退声；配乐为鼓点与弦乐，掌击命中与剑龙撞扇两处爆发，收束后音乐收住、留风声与喘息声。无对白。\n\n【分镜时间轴】\n0–2.5秒：B自青石牌坊顶扑下、玄扇在月下展开，A自长街蹬地迎起，两人半空连拼三记、剑与扇相接爆出短促火星，落向长街时各自滑开、脚步未停。\n2.5–8秒（流霰）：两人贴地高速连段——横斩、扇封、侧闪、回身反击一气呵成；A长剑横扫引动千道银白剑气，光之长河铺满长街与画面约2秒，B以折扇连封、被光流推着滑退、脚下犁出沟痕、两侧灯棚被剑气成片切开、灯笼坠地。\n8–13.5秒（幽罗掌）：两人踏灯棚顶与檐角一路打上三层主灯楼市脊；B翻上楼顶双掌推出，幽青能量化作滔天青浪铺满屋脊与画面约2秒，A以剑插瓦借力、贴浪底滑过、青浪吞没画面一瞬、瓦当成排掀飞，两人翻上楼顶仍在交手。\n13.5–17秒（惊鸿）：A踏檐柱蹬起、借连廊栏杆拧腰腾空，长剑连斩三叠，漫天银白弧光与残影铺满画面约1.5秒，B在弧光中连封三叠、每接一击碎瓦滑开一片、第三击半跪卸力、沿连廊向街口滑去。\n17–20秒（青锁）：B振腕旋扇，数十道幽青锁链自画面四周铺满约1.5秒，缠上A四肢与长剑、将其拉得急坠。\n20–22.5秒（掌击·独占升格）：B贴身突进、一掌印在A胸腹；此处慢镜头特写约1.5秒——掌缘没入A护体光膜、光膜凹陷后碎裂、软甲与衣料随掌力凹陷、A瞳孔骤缩、发丝与披帛悬起、银白星屑离体；随即回实时，A横飞撞翻街口灯棚、翻身落地滑退数步、身后是开阔长街。\n22.5–27秒（剑龙照霰）：A单膝撑地、压剑起身，周身银白能量爆燃，长剑高举引动漫天剑气汇聚成一条巨大银白剑龙、龙身铺满画面约2秒；剑龙俯冲撞向B，B以折扇硬架，扇骨寸断、折扇碎裂、护体青气炸裂，B被龙首轰飞、沿屋脊贴地滑退、撞断一根灯柱。\n27–30秒（收束）：B单膝撑在断柱下、碎扇散落一地、低头喘息、再无战意；A落地、长剑低垂、胸口起伏、向前逼近一步停住；镜头持续后拉升高，看清两人位置与狼藉长街——碎瓦、断柱、坠地灯笼、飘散纸灰，画面在运动中收束，不摆拍、不切黑、不转身离场。\n\n【全局负面约束】\n禁止文字水印字幕UI；禁止两人对峙、站定对视、中途停手、长时间站立；禁止长蓄力、长前摇、摆姿势等技能；禁止慢动作超过1.5秒或出现第二次慢镜头；禁止特效遮住接触点、禁止全屏峰值超过2秒或全程亮屏；禁止角色换脸、换装、改变发型与体型、多余肢体、手指异常、穿模；禁止B改用长剑等其他武器、禁止折扇中途消失或无故复原；禁止A捡灯笼或其他与战斗无关的道具动作、生活化动作；禁止B无故停手或无故消失，其败退必须有碎扇与护体炸裂的可见原因；禁止真实血液、伤口、死亡；禁止场景出现水面、现代建筑、赛博朋克；禁止结尾切黑、转身离场、胜利摆拍。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTi7TwHawAAmqaW.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTi7VPUaoAAxjSm.jpg"]},{"i":19093,"text":"Create a 30-second ultra-realistic cinematic FPV action sequence following a professional motocross rider racing through a devastated abandoned city. Aggressive drone movement, realistic motorcycle physics, flying debris, dust, destruction, dramatic sunset light, detailed environments, intense speed, cinematic motion blur, 4K. No text, logos, or watermarks.\n\n[0–5s] — THE RACE\nFPV camera races directly behind a motocross rider accelerating through a ruined city street. Abandoned cars, shattered windows, collapsed concrete, and debris surround the road. The rider weaves between obstacles at high speed as dust and fragments explode from the tires.\n\n[5–10s] — CLOSE TRACKING\nThe camera dives aggressively alongside the motorcycle, tracking inches from the spinning wheels and suspension. The rider powers through rubble, sparks flying as the bike clips broken metal and concrete. The camera rapidly swings back behind the rider without losing momentum.\n\n[10–15s] — THE RAMP\nThe rider spots a massive collapsed section of roadway forming a natural ramp. He accelerates hard and launches into the air. The FPV camera follows upward, revealing rooftops and the devastated skyline ahead.\n\n[15–20s] — ROOFTOP LANDING\nThe motorcycle lands heavily on a damaged rooftop, suspension compressing realistically. The rider immediately accelerates across the roof, jumping over cracks, fallen beams, and gaps between broken structures. Dust trails behind the rear tire.\n\n[20–25s] — ROOFTOP RUN\nThe camera flies extremely close beside the bike as it blasts across multiple interconnected rooftops. The rider narrowly clears obstacles and jumps another gap while chunks of concrete fall into the streets far below. The camera rolls dynamically with the motorcycle.\n\n[25–30s] — FINAL JUMP\nThe rider reaches the edge of a high rooftop and launches into a final massive jump between two buildings. The camera pulls back into a wide cinematic view, revealing a vast ruined skyline glowing with intense fire and smoke behind him. The motorcycle hangs momentarily against the burning horizon before landing on the opposite rooftop. End with a dramatic cinematic stop.\n\nSTYLE: ultra-realistic motocross action, authentic motorcycle suspension and tire physics, realistic rider movement, high-speed FPV drone cinematography, dynamic camera rolls, natural motion blur, flying dust and debris, detailed destruction, volumetric smoke, dramatic cinematic lighting, realistic fire glow, immersive scale, photorealistic textures, 4K HDR.\n\nAUDIO: powerful motorcycle engine, tire impacts, suspension movement, flying debris, wind rush, concrete crashes, distant explosions and fire ambience. No music, no dialogue.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2105669075389284352/img/bIucSn5wknN8Jhhq.jpg"]},{"i":19094,"text":"A highly detailed textured mixed-media cityscape artwork of a nighttime boulevard in autumn, rendered in a dramatic luxury-gallery style with a black, gold, and glowing amber color world. A long promenade lined with ornate black streetlamps and wooden benches stretches into the distance, with luminous golden-orange trees dominating the right side and monochrome historic buildings fading into mist on the left, all enriched with metallic splatter, raised palette-knife texture, and reflective highlights.\n\nEnvironment:\n• Night street scene with strong one-point perspective, wide pedestrian walkway receding toward a vanishing point\n• Left side features elegant old-world building facades in grayscale, softly veiled by white fog and atmospheric haze\n• Right side features a row of vivid autumn trees with dense glowing foliage in orange, amber, and gold\n• Black roadway runs alongside the trees, separated from the promenade by a line of lampposts\n• Several wooden benches with dark wrought-iron frames are placed along both sides of the walkway\n• Small distant human silhouettes appear near the center background, walking away\n• Sky is deep black, filled with dense gold splatter, scattered white dots, and a few tiny colored specks\n• Avoid modern signage, vehicles, clutter, or any contemporary distractions\n\nLighting:\n• Warm internal glow from the streetlamps, creating soft halos and gentle pools of light\n• Trees appear illuminated from within and from above, emphasizing the fiery foliage\n• Cool misty fill light on the left side softens the grayscale architecture\n• Strong contrast between the luminous gold elements and the dark night sky\n• No harsh flash, no blown-out lamp cores, no flat lighting\n\nMaterials:\n• Thick impasto and palette-knife texture across the entire image surface\n• Metallic gold leaf-like splashes and flecks scattered through the sky, trees, and ground\n• Glossy black lampposts with subtle reflective sheen\n• Benches combine polished wood slats with dark metal frames\n• Pavement has sculpted raised white and gray texture with gold leaf fragments scattered across it\n• Tree foliage appears layered, cracked, and richly textured like heavy acrylic or mixed media paint\n\nComposition:\n• Square format\n• Strong central vanishing point with the walkway leading the eye into the far distance\n• Large foreground lamppost anchors the right side; another prominent lamppost anchors the left-mid foreground\n• Bright golden trees occupy the upper-right half, balancing the darker grayscale buildings on the left\n• Benches and lamps repeat rhythmically to enhance depth and perspective\n\nMood:\nElegant, cinematic, and dreamlike—an opulent autumn night suspended between realism and fine-art fantasy\n\nShot as a high-resolution photorealistic fine-art mixed-media painting reproduction, square crop, ultra-detailed surface texture, crisp depth perspective, 8K realism.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTkQLtiXQAAAEio.jpg"]},{"i":19095,"text":"A tiny world of a famous city contained inside an old vintage matchbox — cinematic, surreal, and highly detailed.\n\nCreate a surreal miniature world of [CITY/LANDMARK] built entirely inside an open vintage matchbox. The matchbox sits on a dark wooden table, while the tiny city rises out of it like an impossibly detailed miniature diorama.\n\nMake the iconic [LANDMARK] the central focal point, surrounded by miniature streets, tiny cars, pedestrians, local buildings, street lamps, trees, and atmospheric details unique to the location. A few matchsticks are scattered naturally around the box, with one glowing ember casting a warm cinematic light across the miniature city.\n\nThe outside of the matchbox remains old, worn, and tactile, with subtle vintage typography and travel-stamp details inspired by [CITY].\n\nStyle: surreal miniature photography, hyper-detailed diorama, cinematic macro lens, realistic materials, dramatic depth of field, warm atmospheric lighting, tiny human details, subtle haze, premium editorial photography, magical realism, physically believable miniature scale, 4:5 vertical composition.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTmBJujbYAAnQO0.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTmBJufbIAAjvsw.jpg"]},{"i":19096,"text":"Create a premium ultra-realistic vertical 4:5 fashion portrait collage in a warm minimalist interior.\nA young woman is standing confidently on the left side of the composition, leaning naturally against a large sculptural curved beige architectural wall. She is wearing a stylish modest all-black outfit — elegant black long-sleeve top, black straight-leg trousers or jeans, and black shoes. Natural relaxed pose, one leg slightly crossed over the other, hands casually positioned near her pockets.\n\nOn the right side, create three vertically arranged framed black-and-white portrait photographs of the same woman, each with a different natural pose:\nWearing stylish black sunglasses, looking toward the camera.\nLooking downward with a calm expression.\nWearing black sunglasses and gently adjusting them with one hand.\nKeep all three portraits consistent with the same woman and facial identity.\nThe interior should have a sophisticated beige, cream and warm sand color palette, soft sunlight entering from the side, beautiful natural window shadows across the wall and floor, subtle cinematic lighting, minimal modern decor, and a small sculptural stone vase with delicate branches in the bottom-left corner.\nPhotorealistic photography, realistic skin texture, realistic fabric, natural proportions, premium editorial fashion aesthetic, soft shadows, architectural photography, high detail, cinematic composition, 8K, clean luxury magazine style,\n\nvertical 4:5.\nImportant: no watermark, no extra text, no logo, no distorted hands, no duplicate people, no artificial-looking face,","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTmPDoaakAAIYDh.jpg"]},{"i":19097,"text":"设计一张3:4竖版的正负形概念插画。\n围合元素：【两组叶片】\n隐藏形象：【飞鸟】\n背景颜色：【暖白色】\n实体颜色：【深森林绿】\n视觉风格：【简洁平面插画，细腻纸张颗粒】\n以隐藏形象的典型外轮廓作为构图目标，将围合元素安排在它的周围。通过调整围合元素的位置、大小、朝向和相向边缘，让中间未上色的背景空隙形成该形象的清晰剪影。围合元素本身也应能辨认。\n画面只保留一个主要负形。负形居中，约占画面宽度的一半，四周保留留白。根据所填形象选择最有辨识度的轮廓特征，用简洁、连续的边缘表现，减少细碎凹凸与装饰。不要依赖内部细节才能识别。\n负形区域与背景保持同色同纹理，轮廓由周围实体边缘共同界定。可以是封闭空隙，也可以自然连通，优先保证隐藏形象完整可辨。不额外画一个填色对象，不给负形添加描边、内部五官、图案、立体高光或投影。实体使用明确的大色块，纸纹轻微，正形与负形都能在缩小观看时辨认。\n只输出一张完整插画，不要多格排版，不添加文字、标志、签名或水印。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n植物主题：围合元素用【两组叶片】，隐藏形象用【飞鸟】，实体颜色用【深森林绿】。\n海洋主题：围合元素用【两组波浪】，隐藏形象用【小鱼】，实体颜色用【海军蓝】。\n这两组已用同一模板分别试生成，画面能辨认出对应的两个形象。优先选轮廓简单的对象，复杂人物或精密产品需要另行验证。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n让周围的形状，把藏在空白里的主角显现出来","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTmUgW6aUAAq0wP.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTmUqjKbIAAap_y.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTmUqjObwAAZoyB.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTmUqjFbEAADyd0.jpg"]},{"i":19098,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n主题方向：东方禅意极简高传播封面\n风格分支：女性审美清爽高对比型\n主体内容：一位古风女子提起少量裙摆，赤足缓慢走过极浅的清水台面 \n情绪母题：自在、清凉、轻松\n场景与意象：极浅水面、珊瑚红落花、湖水蓝水色、女子、白色石台\n构图与空间：9:16竖版，人物位于中下部偏一侧，水面形成大片简洁色块，细小水纹向外扩散，上半部保持完整留白\n色彩控制：高明度白色作为整体环境基底，湖水蓝用于浅水色块，珊瑚红只用于少量漂浮花瓣，人物服装采用奶白；红蓝形成清爽对比但绝不大面积混色\n光线与质感：明亮夏日日光，水面反射清晰，透明感强，无雾无灰\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：水面必须清亮，不要仙气烟雾，整体感觉清凉、年轻、轻快，画面留白处配上合适的文字","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTpFaY_akAA6W4O.jpg"]},{"i":19099,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n风格方向： 午后甜点分享情绪\n场景方向： 客厅小圆桌 / 窗边甜点盘\n服装方向： 淡鹅黄色修身方领针织上衣 + 柔雾灰家居短裙\n气质标签： 明亮、甜、亲近、俏皮、温柔\n身形方向： 丰腴自然曲线\n线条强调： 强\n镜头方向： 女生坐在桌边，身体明显偏向镜头，一只手撑住桌面，另一只手拿着小叉子，把一小块蛋糕递到镜头嘴边位置，眼神看向镜头，像在等男友张嘴\n画幅比例： 9:16\n互动重点： 叉子和甜点成为近距离前景，但人物脸仍保持清楚，形成明显“她正在喂你”的 POV。\n曲线重点： 坐姿轻前倾并偏向镜头，方领修身上衣可以自然表现胸腰比例，桌面承担支撑后动作更稳定。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTpIyAlbkAAhy7P.jpg"]},{"i":19100,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n摄影风格：日间清亮高光CCD生活照风\n写真方向：都市通行时尚写真\n场景方向：现代商业塔楼观光电梯连桥 / 透明玻璃电梯井 / 银白金属框架 / 高层城市天际线\n服装方向：清亮钴蓝色修身U领短袖短上衣 + 冷白色低腰A字超短裙\n气质标签：清冷、明亮、时尚、利落、轻熟\n五官方向：清透高级自然脸\n身形方向：轻盈纤细\n线条强调：强\n镜头方向：大腿及上半身\n姿态动作：刚走出玻璃观光电梯，一只手轻扶金属栏杆，身体侧前方看向镜头\n光线氛围：晴天高亮自然光 + 玻璃与银白金属形成清晰中性反射补光\n滤镜效果：高亮清晰蓝白CCD色彩 + 白净肤色 + 鲜明中间调 + 稳定黑位 + 轻颗粒\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：钴蓝要清澈鲜明，不偏藏蓝；短款上衣露出腰腹与肚脐，U领自然表现胸线；玻璃结构保持真实通透，不做科幻CG感","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTpFtNDaIAE_jHm.jpg"]},{"i":19101,"text":"A visually striking colored-pencil and wax-crayon illustration of [CITY / COUNTRY / LANDMARK], transforming from a loose handmade sketch into a richly detailed scene. The artwork begins with visible pencil construction lines, rough strokes, scribbles, erased marks, and unfinished shapes, gradually evolving into the recognizable architecture, landscapes, streets, cultural details, and atmosphere of [CITY / COUNTRY / LANDMARK]. Colored-pencil textures and layered wax-crayon strokes remain visible throughout, giving the artwork an authentic handmade feel. Warm textured paper background, imperfect artistic marks, subtle grain, expressive linework, vibrant yet harmonious colors, cinematic composition, strong depth, charming editorial illustration aesthetic, highly detailed, artistic rather than photorealistic. Integrate the name “[NAME]” elegantly into the composition as part of the artwork.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTn1KSZbkAEzN-4.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTn1LIOaUAANNFs.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTn1MAFbsAAlHB5.jpg"]},{"i":19102,"text":"{\n  \"image_generation_prompt\": {\n    \"subject\": {\n      \"description\": \"Young woman with long, straight, medium-brown hair\",\n      \"pose\": \"Leaning naturally toward the open car window, resting her head gently on one hand with a relaxed and elegant expression\",\n      \"action\": \"Taking a selfie using a smartphone while looking at the phone screen\",\n      \"expression\": \"Soft, calm and confident expression with a subtle natural smile\"\n    },\n\n    \"identity_and_hair\": {\n      \"face\": \"Natural youthful facial features, realistic facial proportions, soft features\",\n      \"hair\": \"Long, straight, smooth medium-brown hair, neatly arranged with natural individual strands, slightly illuminated by warm evening light\",\n      \"consistency\": \"Keep facial structure, hairstyle and hair color consistent throughout the image\"\n    },\n\n    \"clothing\": {\n      \"top\": \"Simple elegant white ribbed turtleneck long-sleeve top\",\n      \"accessories\": \"Small minimalist stud earrings\",\n      \"style\": \"Clean, modest, sophisticated and minimal\"\n    },\n\n    \"props\": {\n      \"item\": \"Modern premium smartphone resembling an iPhone 16 Pro Max\",\n      \"details\": \"Realistic proportions, accurate triple-camera layout, natural hand grip, realistic reflections on the phone body\"\n    },\n\n    \"vehicle\": {\n      \"type\": \"Luxury black Toyota Land Cruiser\",\n      \"detail\": \"Glossy black exterior, premium side mirror, realistic automotive surfaces and reflections\"\n    },\n\n    \"composition\": {\n      \"main_focus\": \"The vehicle side mirror occupies the central visual area\",\n      \"perspective\": \"Camera positioned close to the exterior side mirror, photographing the reflection\",\n      \"framing\": \"Wide cinematic landscape composition with the mirror prominently framed\",\n      \"visual_balance\": \"Mirror and reflected woman are the primary focal point while the surrounding road and trees provide depth\",\n      \"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\"\n    },\n\n    \"environment\": {\n      \"location\": \"Quiet outdoor road surrounded by trees\",\n      \"background\": \"Softly blurred trees, road, natural landscape and warm orange-blue evening sky\",\n      \"atmosphere\": \"Peaceful golden-hour evening with subtle cinematic depth\",\n      \"depth_of_field\": \"Shallow depth of field with soft natural bokeh in the distant background\"\n    },\n\n    \"lighting\": {\n      \"type\": \"Golden hour\",\n      \"characteristics\": \"Warm sunlight, soft golden highlights on the woman's hair and face, realistic shadows, subtle reflections on the black vehicle\"\n    },\n\n    \"photography\": {\n      \"style\": \"Ultra-realistic luxury lifestyle photography\",\n      \"aesthetic\": \"Minimalist Instagram editorial aesthetic\",\n      \"camera\": \"Professional full-frame camera look\",\n      \"lens\": \"35mm cinematic perspective\",\n      \"focus\": \"Sharp focus on the side mirror and reflected woman\",\n      \"quality\": \"Photorealistic, highly detailed, natural skin texture, realistic hair strands, cinematic depth\"\n    },\n\n    \"technical_constraints\": {\n      \"reflection\": \"Physically accurate side-mirror reflection with correct perspective and optical orientation\",\n      \"anatomy\": \"Natural human anatomy and realistic hands\",\n      \"phone\": \"Correct smartphone proportions without warping\",\n      \"vehicle\": \"Realistic automotive geometry and reflections\",\n      \"distortion_control\": \"No exaggerated facial features, body proportions or mirror distortion\",\n      \"output\": \"16:9 landscape photograph\"\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"negative_prompt\": \"cartoon, illustration, painting, CGI, artificial face, plastic skin, distorted face, deformed hands, extra fingers, missing fingers, bad anatomy, duplicated person, duplicate reflection, distorted mirror, incorrect reflection angle, warped smartphone, oversized phone, unrealistic car geometry, messy hair, excessive makeup, unnatural lighting, blurry face, low resolution, pixelated, oversaturated, text, logo, watermark\"\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HToGmiXbIAAvOiN.jpg"]},{"i":19103,"text":"Codex+GPT 6.1 Sol制作CCD风的Motion Video，\n这效果有点燥啊🥳\n\n12 张人像，24 秒，给夏天按下加速键。☀️\n\n透明玻璃炸裂、镜头穿过层层撕纸、漫画爆帧，再把画面打散成像素重组。让阳光、人像和城市的色彩，跟着鼓点一起爆发。\n\n这支 Motion Video 叫《阳光超载》。戴上耳机，感受这场夏日视觉轰炸😆","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2106048666108887040/img/9qv8erOOQfws0_8K.jpg"]},{"i":19104,"text":"Traditional East-Asian mother-of-pearl inlay artwork quadtriptych on glossy black lacquer ground. 4 vertical panels showing 4 seasons, each with distinct color palette while maintaining unified artistic style. Shallow 3D relief where every shell element sits slightly raised and casts real shadows.\n\nPANEL 1 (LEFT - SPRING): Cherry blossom trees with pink and white iridescent shell petals falling through air. Young koi fish swimming in clear pond with emerging lotus shoots. Blue butterflies emerging from cocoons. Delicate pink clouds above. Traditional Chinese pavilion with fresh green moss on roof tiles. Soft pastel iridescence - pink, light green, pearl white, soft coral. Morning light atmosphere.\n\nPANEL 2 (CENTER-LEFT - SUMMER): Full blooming lotus flowers in pink and white on black mirror pond. Large mature koi fish with vibrant orange and white scales. Dragonflies with iridescent blue-green wings hovering above water. Lush green pine trees with dense shell needles. Waterfall flowing vigorously between rocks. Bright midday lighting. Palette: vibrant teal, turquoise, coral pink, emerald green, bright silver.\n\nPANEL 3 (CENTER-RIGHT - AUTUMN): Maple trees with red, orange and gold iridescent shell leaves falling on pond water. Mature koi fish with deep crimson and gold scales swimming slowly. Golden-orange clouds drifting above. Silver and copper cranes standing among rocks. Chrysanthemum flowers in amber and burgundy tones. Warm golden hour lighting. Palette: crimson, gold, amber, copper, deep orange, burgundy, bronze.\n\nPANEL 4 (RIGHT - WINTER): Snow-covered pine branches with white and silver shell needles. White and pale pink plum blossoms emerging through snow. Koi fish swimming under partially frozen pond with ice crystals. White cranes with silver-tipped feathers in flight. Delicate pearl snowflakes falling gently. Moon and stars visible through thin clouds. Cool evening lighting. Palette: pearl white, silver, pale blue, icy turquoise, soft pink, deep black.\n\nUNIFIED ELEMENTS ACROSS ALL PANELS: Continuous black mirror pond connecting all 4 panels. Koi fish present in each panel (different sizes/colors per season). Consistent mother-of-pearl inlay technique throughout. Visible vertical dividers between panels. Iridescent shell surfaces catching light differently in each season.\n\nTECHNICAL: 8K resolution, horizontal 16:9 aspect ratio, 4-panel quadtriptych layout with visible divisions, photorealistic CGI rendering, shallow 3D relief with real shadows, soft directional studio light creating rainbow iridescence on all shell surfaces.\n\nMOOD: Peaceful, meditative, cyclical, zen, luxurious handcrafted aesthetic, East Asian traditional art, serene beauty of nature's seasons.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2106060791493406721/img/k8M4IYNVDOp2blCx.jpg"]},{"i":19105,"text":"Create a 30-second high-budget cinematic 3D animated comedy short titled “THE GREAT FISH HEIST — Cat Burglar Kitchen Raid.” A chubby orange tabby cat with enormous green eyes wears a tiny black turtleneck and miniature black ski mask pushed up on his forehead. He moves like a serious secret agent despite being hilariously clumsy. Keep the same character, fur, outfit, proportions, and facial expressions throughout. Premium feature-film animation, expressive fur, cinematic moonlight, realistic physics, polished comedy timing, 4K. No text, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.\n\n[0–4s] — THE TARGET\nWide establishing shot of a beautiful modern kitchen at night. Cool moonlight streams through the windows while everything remains completely silent. The camera slowly moves toward the counter. Two enormous glowing green eyes suddenly appear from behind a fruit bowl. The cat slowly rises into view.\n\n[4–8s] — STEALTH MODE\nThe cat carefully sneaks across the kitchen counter toward an unattended salmon fillet on a cutting board. He suddenly bumps a salt shaker. It falls in slow motion. He catches it with one paw just before it hits the counter, freezes dramatically, then quietly puts it back and wipes his forehead with exaggerated relief.\n\n[8–11s] — THE SALMON\nHe reaches the salmon. His pupils become enormous with excitement and a tiny tear of joy rolls down his cheek. He slowly extends one trembling paw toward the fish, claws delicately reaching forward.\n\n[11–14s] — THE BARK\nA loud dog bark echoes from another room. The cat instantly freezes. His fur expands dramatically, his body puffs up, and his tail becomes perfectly rigid. Without thinking, he grabs the entire salmon and stuffs it into his mouth, cheeks bulging ridiculously.\n\n[14–18s] — DOG ATTACK\nA huge golden retriever suddenly slides into the kitchen, paws scrambling across the polished floor before crashing into the refrigerator. The cat is already sitting on top of the fridge with the salmon sticking out of his mouth. He looks down at the dog with an exaggerated expression of complete superiority.\n\n[18–22s] — THE CLIMB\nThe dog begins stacking kitchen chairs to reach the refrigerator. The cat casually chews the salmon while watching. The unstable chair tower grows taller and begins wobbling dangerously. The dog looks upward, realizing too late that the tower is collapsing.\n\n[22–25s] — CHAOS\nThe chair tower collapses. The dog crashes into a pile of pots and pans, creating a huge comedic explosion of cookware. A metal colander lands perfectly over his head like a helmet. He sits in the wreckage, slightly stunned but still happily wagging his tail.\n\n[25–28s] — VICTORY\nThe cat finishes the salmon and drops the clean fish skeleton onto the dog's head. He slowly pulls his tiny ski mask over his eyes, turns toward the window, and begins an exaggerated moonwalk across the counter.\n\n[28–30s] — THE ESCAPE\nThe cat reaches the window, turns back toward the dog, gives a cool little salute, then disappears into the moonlit night. The camera holds on the confused golden retriever sitting beneath the colander.\n\nCUT TO BLACK.\n\nSTYLE: premium cinematic 3D animation, feature-film quality, highly detailed realistic orange fur, expressive green eyes, physically believable movement with exaggerated cartoon comedy, cinematic moonlight, realistic reflections, polished kitchen environment, dynamic camera work, depth of field, smooth animation, strong comedic timing, 4K HDR.\n\nAUDIO: quiet nighttime ambience, subtle sneaking sounds, salt shaker rattle, dramatic pause, loud dog bark, paws sliding on tile, crashing cookware, metallic impacts, playful movement sounds, and a comedic final sting. No dialogue.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2106071839277715456/img/B6qP-Icm9-6I2A__.jpg"]},{"i":19106,"text":"→ 直接出图。\n\nGet 玩法 + 完整提示词👇\n\n【正常照片 → 囧场合反转｜通用提示词】 \n\n请基于我上传的参考图进行真人照片改编。\n\n严格保留原图中的：\n人物身份与五官、发型、服装、动物种类、背景环境、拍摄地点、镜头角度、人物与动物的位置关系、整体构图和真实摄影质感。\n\n不要重新设计场景，不要更换人物，不要改变服装。\n\n在原本正常、平静的合照基础上，制造一个“突然发生意外”的囧瞬间：\n\n人物突然被旁边的动物／物体／环境动作吓到，身体下意识向后缩，肩膀抬起，双手紧张收在胸前或做防御动作，眼睛睁大，嘴巴自然张开，形成真实而夸张的惊讶表情。\n\n同时让旁边的动物产生同步的意外反应，例如突然回头、张嘴、抬手、身体后仰、愣住或受到惊吓。\n\n重点是双方同时被彼此吓到，形成“人吓动物，动物也吓人”的荒诞喜剧瞬间。\n\n画面必须像游客手机抓拍到的真实照片，不要做成漫画表情，不要过度变形五官。保留自然阳光、真实皮肤、真实动物毛发、真实运动惯性与轻微抓拍感。\n\n最终效果：\n\n正常旅游照片 + 突发意外 + 双方同步惊吓 + 真实抓拍 + 强烈反差喜剧。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTwhn2qaoAENZbJ.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTwholtasAA-sdD.jpg"]},{"i":19107,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n主题方向：东方禅意极简高传播封面\n风格分支：女性审美治愈型\n主体内容：一位女子与一只白鹿并肩站在开阔浅色草坡上，女子轻轻侧头看向白鹿\n情绪母题：陪伴、治愈、安静喜悦\n场景与意象：白鹿、浅色草坡、青蓝天空、桃橙色花簇、女子\n构图与空间：9:16竖版，人物与白鹿位于画面下方约三分之一，天空占据上半部，人物和鹿之间形成简单关系，顶部完整留白\n色彩控制：象牙白和浅草绿作为高明度环境基底，青蓝用于天空，桃橙只用于一小簇花朵，白鹿保持纯净暖白；避免整张画面同色化\n光线与质感：明亮柔和日光，空气清晰，简洁平面插画感\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：白鹿必须优雅自然，不做仙兽发光效果，整体积极、安静、明亮而不幼稚，画面留白处配上合适的文字","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTt_EccbkAEltp4.jpg"]},{"i":19108,"text":"④ Create the result\n\nPrompt: Keep the same features of the attached person, without changes. Reference picture: photo sent.\nFace: keep the exact same person as the reference picture. Format:\nfeaturing a young South Asian man with green eyes and a well-groomed beard. In the foreground, he is shown full-body, dressed in a green linen casual suit, leaning casually against a stone ledge, with a gold necklace and a watch. His eyes are green. Overlaid in the background is a large, close-up portrait of his face, with his striking green eyes as a focus. The entire composition has a dreamlike, brushstroke texture, set against a backdrop of a blurred mountain valley at dusk, creating a artistic and nostalgic atmosphere.\"","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTt75roaQAEvPyS.jpg"]},{"i":19109,"text":"上传图1作为主体与构图的唯一参考。\n将图1转换为一张3:4竖版孔版印刷风格作品。准确保留原图中的人物身份、五官轮廓、发型、服装、姿态、主体数量及主要构图关系，只改变画面的印刷媒介与色彩表现。\n将照片压缩成2—3种高饱和专色油墨，例如荧光红、钴蓝与暖黄。分别用不同色层表现高光、中间调与阴影，色层重叠处自然形成新的混合颜色。\n使用清晰可见的半调网点、颗粒排线、粗糙色块边缘和局部油墨渗透。不同油墨层之间保留轻微套印偏移，让人物轮廓和物体边缘出现克制的红蓝错位。\n背景采用带有细微纤维、压痕与吸墨痕迹的暖白色纸张。整体像真实孔版印刷成品，颜色直接、层次简洁，同时保证人物脸部和主体结构仍然清楚可辨。\n禁止改变人物身份、重组服装、增加人物、破坏主体结构、大面积错位、数字故障、霓虹发光、塑料质感、复杂渐变、拼贴、边框、文字、Logo和水印。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n• 人像：红蓝双色杂志肖像\n• 建筑：蓝黄城市旅行版画\n• 食物：高饱和复古菜单插图\n• 宠物：三色手工印刷卡片\n• 产品：限色包装广告视觉\n• 国风：朱红、墨黑与宣纸色孔版画\n\n📌 一句话总结\n孔版错印，就是用有限的油墨、可见的网点和轻微的套印偏差，把普通照片变成一张真正有印刷触感的作品。”","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTrFEAzbkAAOUHB.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTrFEA3awAAmHL0.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTrFEA0bUAArnZk.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTrFEA7bkAAjdCB.jpg"]},{"i":19110,"text":"Create a whimsical, highly detailed miniature world inspired by [COUNTRY], as if the entire country has been transformed into a handcrafted storybook landscape.\n\nRolling hills covered in rich, tactile, velvety vegetation rise from a calm body of water, with clusters of tiny charming buildings inspired by the authentic architecture of [COUNTRY] scattered naturally across the hills. Every building has unique shapes, colors, windows, roofs, balconies, and architectural details characteristic of the country.\n\nSurround the villages with exaggerated ornamental trees, sculpted shrubs, colorful flowers, winding paths, and tiny environmental details, all appearing handcrafted from soft clay, wool, felt, paper and tiny textured beads. Add small boats on the water reflecting the colorful landscape.\n\nThe entire scene should feel like a luxury handcrafted miniature diorama, playful yet sophisticated, with surreal proportions, rich saturated colors, intricate surface texture, soft atmospheric lighting, dramatic cloudy sky, cinematic depth, realistic water reflections, and an enchanting storybook atmosphere.\n\nSubtly incorporate recognizable visual elements of [COUNTRY] into the architecture and landscape without using obvious flags, text, or tourist clichés.\n\nUltra-detailed, tactile textures, miniature photography aesthetic, whimsical fantasy realism, cinematic composition, soft volumetric light, shallow depth of field, highly polished 3D artwork, visually captivating, no people, no text.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTrX30nbwAEFBWo.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTrX30qawAA5ENb.jpg"]},{"i":19111,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n摄影风格：日间清亮高光CCD生活照风\n写真方向：都市出行生活写真\n场景方向：现代有轨电车站台 / 白色玻璃候车亭 / 银色轨道 / 蓝天 / 远处电车轻微虚化\n服装方向：草莓红色修身方领短袖针织上衣 + 奶白色低腰修身超短裤\n气质标签：元气、明亮、清爽、都市、亲近\n五官方向：元气初恋感自然脸\n身形方向：轻盈纤细\n线条强调：强\n镜头方向：半身到大腿\n姿态动作：站在候车亭边，一只手拿手机，另一只手轻拨头发，转头看向镜头\n光线氛围：晴天侧前方自然光 + 白色站台和玻璃候车亭形成清亮补光\n滤镜效果：高亮清晰红白CCD色彩 + 白皙肤色 + 清楚高光 + 明亮中间调 + 轻颗粒\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：红色鲜亮但不荧光；人物保持真实通勤生活感，不像交通广告；胸线和腰线清楚但自然","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTuO_XkawAAZG94.jpg"]},{"i":19112,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n风格方向： 出门前安静暧昧情绪\n场景方向： 卧室穿衣镜 / 梳妆台旁\n服装方向： 冷雾蓝修身吊带家居裙或简洁约会裙\n气质标签： 温柔、安静、轻熟、期待、亲密\n身形方向： 丰腴自然曲线\n线条强调： 强\n镜头方向： 女生背对镜头站在穿衣镜前，镜头非常靠近她身后，像男友刚帮她扣好项链；她一只手轻触颈侧项链，身体从腰部开始轻微侧转，回头直接看向镜头，嘴角带很轻的笑\n画幅比例： 9:16\n互动重点： 不需要把男友拍出来，通过近距离后方 POV、项链动作和回眸，就能明确建立两个人之间的关系。\n曲线重点： 背面到侧面的自然转身能连续呈现肩背、腰线、腰臀和腿部轮廓，比刻意扭腰更自然。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTuOnoAawAArI-W.jpg"]},{"i":19113,"text":"DURATION:\n10 seconds\nSTYLE:\nUltra-realistic live-action, cinematic Korean school action drama, photorealistic, 8K, realistic human movement, dynamic action choreography, realistic physics, fast-paced multi-shot editing, cinematic camera movement.\nMC:\nEriek @image1 — young woman, tall and very slender, wearing a realistic Korean high-school female uniform. Preserve Eriek's facial identity, body proportions, hairstyle, and appearance adapted to a female high-school student.\nENVIRONMENT:\nOutdoor Korean high-school basketball court, bright daytime, realistic school buildings, basketball hoop, students in the background, natural sunlight.\nAUDIO:\nNatural school ambience, basketball sounds, shoe friction, loud basketball impacts, students laughing, sharp air-whoosh during the jump and 720° kick, extremely fast basketball whoosh. No music.\nSCENE & TIMELINE:\nSHOT 1 — 0–2.5s\nWide side shot of the outdoor basketball court.\nEriek is squatting at the edge of the court, calmly fixing her loose shoelace.\nSuddenly, a basketball flies into frame at high speed and slams directly into Eriek's upper body.\nThe hard impact knocks her backward onto the court, accompanied by realistic camera shake and motion blur.\nSHOT 2 — 2.5–3.5s\nHard cut to a group of young female students in basketball uniforms laughing loudly at Eriek after deliberately hitting her with the ball.\nSHOT 3 — 3.5–5.5s\nHard cut back to Eriek sitting on the ground.\nShe calmly picks up the basketball, gives a confident, mischievous smile, stands up, and faces the group.\nSHOT 4 — 5.5–8.0s\nContinuous side-angle shot keeping both Eriek and the ball in frame.\nEriek throws the basketball straight upward several meters, jumps up after it, and performs a full 720° spinning kick (two complete aerial rotations).\nDuring the second rotation, her foot connects cleanly with the ball, launching it horizontally across the court at extreme velocity without cutaways.\nSHOT 5 — 8.0–10.0s\nDynamic tracking shot follows the fast-moving basketball.\nThe ball slams into the torso of the main bully, knocking her backward to roll across the court.\nThe other students freeze in shock. End right after the student finishes rolling.\nCRITICAL ACTION ORDER:\n * Eriek picks up the basketball.\n * Eriek throws the basketball straight upward.\n * The basketball visibly rises.\n * Eriek jumps upward after the ball.\n * Eriek reaches the ball in mid-air.\n * Eriek performs two complete 360° rotations (720° spin kick).\n * Her foot cleanly strikes the ball during the second rotation.\n * The ball rockets forward at high speed.\n * The ball hits the bully.\n * The bully is knocked backward and rolls.\nNo weapons, no blood, no gore, no supernatural effects.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2106350553416753152/img/Hb9koAn8x0HKBW3a.jpg"]},{"i":19114,"text":"Use the uploaded image as the master identity reference. Create the same woman with the exact same face and facial identity ,preserve her facial structure, eyes, eyebrows, nose, lips, jawline, cheekbones, skin tone, proportions, natural asymmetry, and recognizable features with maximum accuracy. Do not redesign or beautify her face.\n\nCreate an ultra-photorealistic luxury fashion portrait of her wearing a sculptural crimson-red silk gown. The glossy silk forms enormous flowing folds that wrap elegantly around her body and rise dramatically behind her shoulders like waves, creating a striking couture silhouette. Fitted gathered waist, deep V neckline, flowing red fabric cascading downward. Long loose dark-brown wavy hair, elegant red lips, subtle refined makeup, delicate gold earrings and necklace. Warm directional studio lighting, rich deep-red textured background, realistic silk reflections, natural fabric physics, sophisticated luxury editorial campaign, highly detailed skin texture, photorealistic 8K. Front-facing composition, medium-length framing, not head-to-toe.\n\nNegative Prompt\n\nDifferent face, identity drift, facial redesign, altered facial structure, different eyes, different nose, different lips, different jawline, different cheekbones, changed skin tone, exaggerated beauty, plastic skin, over-smoothed skin, excessive makeup, face distortion, asymmetrical eyes, warped features, unnatural expression, extra limbs, extra fingers, malformed hands, deformed body, unrealistic anatomy, distorted fabric, stiff fabric, fake silk, low detail, blurry face, CGI look, cartoon, illustration, 3D render, oversharpening, excessive retouching, watermark, logo, text, cropped face, side profile.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTtdvqCa0AAtuzb.jpg"]},{"i":19115,"text":"Here's how to fix it...\n\n1. Generate the image in GPT 2.5 like normal\n(it's still the best at composition & following your prompt)\n\n2. Run it through FLUX 3 with the GPT image as reference:\n\n\"Recreate this exact photo as a real unretouched iPhone photo: same person, same face, same hair, same clothes, same pose, same framing and light. Real skin pores, fine lines, natural colour, slight sensor grain. No text.\"\n\n3. Upscale it to 4K with Bytedance Upscale\n\nNow it looks like an actual photo.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTtgbXdWcAAWtN_.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTtgcdLXUAAZyoO.jpg"]},{"i":19116,"text":"Create a premium cinematic automotive poster featuring [CAR MODEL], designed as if the vehicle was born from the visual identity of [CITY/COUNTRY]. The car is the hero, shown in a dramatic 3/4 front view, with its body subtly incorporating recognizable local architecture, road markings, textures, materials, and cultural design cues — never as literal decorations, but seamlessly integrated into the vehicle’s form.\n\nSurround the car with a minimal, atmospheric version of [CITY], with iconic architecture appearing softly in the distance. Wet asphalt reflections, realistic headlights, subtle atmospheric haze, dramatic directional lighting, deep shadows, fine automotive details, realistic paint reflections, low camera angle, premium automotive advertising photography.\n\nPoster composition: huge negative space, clean editorial layout, small refined typography reading “BUILT BY [CITY]”, tiny technical specifications beneath it, subtle blueprint/grid lines, sophisticated luxury-car magazine aesthetic, muted cinematic color palette with one strong accent color inspired by the city, ultra-detailed, photorealistic, 8K, no people, no logos, no watermark.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTtu7LBaQAE4s3X.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTtu7LAaAAEYxpA.jpg"]},{"i":19117,"text":"④ Create the result\n\nPrompt:\nA high-resolution, realistic portrait of a stylish young South Asian man sitting comfortably outdoors in a park or open-air café during twilight/evening. He has short, styled hair, and subtle stubble. He is wearing light silk yellow shalwar kameez, white sneakers, and a luxury silver watch with a bright blue dial on his left wrist.\nHe is sitting cross-legged in a modern dark woven patio chair, resting one arm on a small round outdoor table with a cup of hot black coffee (with 'COFFEE' printed on the mug). One hand is placed thoughtfully under his chin, looking directly at the camera with a confident expression.\nBackground: A blurred lush green park setting with soft warm bokeh street lights. In the top right corner of the sky, a large, clear full moon is glowing. Warm, cinematic twilight lighting, sharp focus on the subject, photorealistic, 8k quality, depth of field. Keep original face and hairstyle 100% reference","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTt75roaQAEvPyS.jpg"]},{"i":19118,"text":"Create a 30-second ultra-realistic cinematic FPV travel film showcasing the futuristic energy, natural beauty, and cultural character of TURKEY. Blend cyberpunk technology with Istanbul’s historic architecture, vibrant streets, Mediterranean and Aegean coastlines, and spectacular night imagery. Use extreme-speed FPV drone movement, hyperlapse, seamless spatial transitions, and dense but controlled flash-cut editing. 8K cinematic realism, photorealistic environments, realistic crowds and vehicles, dramatic lighting, smooth motion blur only during rapid transitions, premium commercial cinematography. No text, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.\n\n[0–6s] — CITY FROM THE SKY\nBegin above Istanbul at sunrise, surrounded by mist and clouds. An FPV drone dives rapidly between modern skyscrapers before sweeping toward the Bosphorus. The scene transitions from warm daylight into blue-hour neon as the city below comes alive. Cars create flowing light trails while the camera races through vibrant streets, revealing Istanbul’s futuristic energy beside historic architecture.\n\n[6–12s] — TECHNOLOGY & HISTORY\nUse rapid cinematic match cuts: a modern tram glides through the city, instantly transitioning into a close-up of a traditional Turkish coffee being prepared; a speeding ferry cuts across the Bosphorus, followed by a dramatic aerial reveal of the Hagia Sophia and Blue Mosque. Turkish street life, glowing shopfronts, crowded avenues, and modern architecture flash together in rhythmic visual transitions.\n\n[12–18s] — SPATIAL FOLD TO THE COAST\nA moving object passes directly across the lens and becomes a seamless transition into the Turkish coastline. The camera bursts over crystal-clear turquoise water near Antalya and races along dramatic Mediterranean cliffs. Speedboats cut through the sea, white spray exploding behind them. Transition toward Cappadocia as hot-air balloons suddenly fill the sky above the surreal rock formations.\n\n[18–24s] — TURKEY IN MOTION\nThe camera dives between Cappadocia’s towering rock formations and rapidly transitions to a bustling Istanbul street at golden hour. Match-cut between a Turkish flag waving in the wind, a crowded bazaar, traditional architecture, modern city traffic, and people enjoying the coastline. Use fast but visually coherent transitions that emphasize Turkey’s contrast between ancient heritage and modern life.\n\n[24–30s] — THE GRAND FINALE\nNight falls instantly. The camera rises above Istanbul and reveals the Bosphorus illuminated by thousands of city lights. A massive coordinated drone light show forms elegant abstract shapes above the skyline while boats move across the glowing water below. The camera pulls rapidly backward and upward into an enormous aerial panorama, revealing Istanbul stretching across both sides of the Bosphorus.\n\nEnd with a powerful wide cinematic shot of the illuminated city, water, bridges, historic landmarks, and night sky.\n\nSTYLE: ultra-realistic 8K cinematic travel film, photorealistic Turkey, extreme FPV drone cinematography, high-speed hyperlapse, seamless spatial transitions, dynamic match cuts, realistic crowds and vehicles, detailed architecture, natural atmospheric haze, volumetric light, cinematic depth of field, realistic reflections, subtle motion blur only during fast transitions, HDR, premium tourism-commercial quality.\n\nCOLOR: begin with warm natural daylight, transition into cool blue and cyan tones during futuristic city sequences, use rich turquoise and golden tones along the coast, then finish with deep blue night and warm city lights.\n\nAUDIO: cinematic electronic pulse building with the speed of the visuals, Istanbul street ambience, ferry horns, traffic, waves, wind, subtle traditional Turkish instrumental textures, then a powerful musical rise for the final aerial reveal. No spoken dialogue.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2106439575665364992/img/Lmryb57gSh4C23Cw.jpg"]},{"i":19119,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n主题方向：东方禅意极简高传播封面\n风格分支：女性审美文艺传播型\n主体内容：一位古风女子站在几张悬挂的长方形诗笺之间，抬手轻扶其中一张\n情绪母题：阅读、风、轻文艺、自由感\n场景与意象：白色空间、少量悬挂诗笺、玫瑰红丝绳、青柠绿小叶、女子\n构图与空间：9:16竖版，几张诗笺形成纵向节奏但不超过4张，人物位于下方偏中，上方和左侧留出完整标题空间\n色彩控制：暖白作为主体基底，诗笺保持象牙白，玫瑰红只用于细丝绳和一枚小印记，青柠绿用于少量枝叶；高饱和颜色面积很小但醒目\n光线与质感：明亮室外柔光，纸张边缘清晰，极轻纸面纹理\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：诗笺本身不要出现可读文字，重点是纸张、风和人物关系，画面现代、极简、有文化感，画面留白处配上合适的文字","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT2UkckaMAAaTdg.jpg"]}];